---
title: Balsamic Brussels Sprouts
course: side
servings: 2
time_active: 5
time_total: 30
leftovers: good
tags: [quick]
pairs: [chicken-pesto-and-mozzarella-panini]
---

Heat the oven to 400°F.

Toss @brussels sprouts{2%cups}(halved) with @olive oil{1%tbsp}, @balsamic vinegar{1%tbsp}, @honey{1%tsp}, @salt, and @black pepper{}. Spread on a #baking sheet{}.

Roast ~{20-25%minutes}, shaking the pan halfway, until caramelized.

Sprinkle with @parmesan{1/4%cup}(grated) for the last ~{2%minutes}.
